-- חוזר לבעלויות תשפ"ב/1 (26.7.2021): 1. פתיחת תיקי גננות ודיווח משרות; 2. העסקת
-- עובדי הוראה, עובדי בעלות, בגני הילדים לחינוך מיוחד המוכרים שאינם רשמיים,
-- בהתאם לרפורמת אופק חדש בשנה"ל תשפ"ב.
-- Part א: how every owner of a recognised unofficial special-education
-- kindergarten opens online files for its teaching employees and reports
-- their positions. Part ב: applying Ofek Hadash to those kindergartens from
-- תשפ"ב — the owner's and the Ministry's duties, who joins, the work week
-- of kindergarten teachers and of health and arts therapists, part-time and
-- over-100% employment, mothers' and age hours, activity hours, promotion,
-- role bonuses, the grade, the salary advances — and the annexed
-- commitment, letters, forms, examples and contacts.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `תשפ"ב/1 פתיחת תיקי גננות ודיווח משרות; העסקה בגני ילדים לחינוך מיוחד מוכרים שאינם רשמיים באופק חדש`

-- akn:preamble/p1 akn:preamble/p2 akn:preamble/p3 akn:preamble/p4 akn:preamble/p5 akn:preamble/p6 akn:preamble/p7 akn:preamble/p8 The letterhead, the date and the reference number; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 akn:preamble/p10 akn:preamble/p11 akn:preamble/p12 akn:preamble/p13 akn:preamble/p14 akn:preamble/p15 The circular's number, the addressees (owners of recognised unofficial special-education kindergartens), the greeting, the two subjects and the opening of the statement of purpose; no rule.

-- Time in the regulative rules is counted in DAYS from 26 July 2021 (day
-- 0), the circular's date, unless a rule says otherwise.
`26 July 2021`     MEANS 0
`15 August 2021`   MEANS 20
`31 December 2021` MEANS 158

-- The owner of the kindergarten (הבעלות) employs its teaching employees;
-- common.l4 names it `the local authority or owning body`.

@desc The actions the circular asks of the owner, the reporting officer and the teaching employee.
DECLARE `kindergarten action` IS ONE OF
    `appoint a reporting officer`
    `appoint a second reporting officer`
    `pass the reporting permission to another`
    `instruct the teachers to open an online file`
    `approve the file and verify the documents as true to the original`
    `report the teachers' positions`
    `obtain an employment approval`
    `submit the commitment to join Ofek Hadash through the portal`
    `send the Ofek Hadash advance letter and collect the teacher's acknowledgement`
    `submit a request to the exceptions committee`
    `submit the commitment to complete a degree`
    `submit a request to leave Ofek Hadash`
    `pay salary by the Ofek Hadash grade and deduct the advances`
    `pay the Ofek Hadash advance` HAS `advance paid` IS A NUMBER
    `instruct the existing teachers to check their data on the portal`
    `send the salary interface to the Ministry's contractor`
    `hear the exception requests`
    `hear the requests to leave`
    `check each teacher's joining conditions`
    `set the Ofek Hadash grade`
    `compute the Ofek Hadash profile`
    `reimburse the owner net of the advances`

§§ `The two subjects`

-- akn:art_a The first subject, part א (reporting for the kindergarten profile), for every owner whether or not it joined Ofek Hadash in תשפ"א; its rules follow.
-- akn:art_b/p1 The second subject, part ב (employment under Ofek Hadash from תשפ"ב), for owners asking to join in תשפ"ב; its rules follow.

§§ `א. דיווח מצבת עובדי ההוראה`

-- ¶1-2: from תשפ"א, every teaching employee of such a kindergarten opens an
-- online file with the Ministry, and the owner reports the employment every
-- year.
@ref akn:art_b__para_a/p1 akn:art_b__para_a/p2
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `the yearly report of employment` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `report the teachers' positions`
    WITHIN 365
    LEST BREACH BY `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ב/1 §א: the owner reports its teaching employees' employment every year"

-- akn:art_b__para_a/p3 akn:art_b__para_a/p5 akn:art_b__para_a/p6 akn:art_b__para_a/p7 The background and purpose of the reporting, the call for cooperation and the lead-in to the stages; no rule.

-- ¶4: what the Ministry determines from the reports.
@ref akn:art_b__para_a/p4
@desc What ¶4 says the Ministry determines from the reported information.
DECLARE `determination from the reports` IS ONE OF
    `the education rank, certification and seniority for salary`
    `further rights such as training bonuses, the jubilee grant, joining Ofek Hadash and promotion`
    `employment approvals and the criminal-record check`
    `the kindergarten's budget by its teaching staff (the profile)`

GIVEN d IS A `determination from the reports`
GIVETH A Party
DECIDE `who determines from the reports` d IS
    `the Ministry of Education`

-- Stage A (subpara 1): one reporting officer per owner, the owner's own
-- employee (not a service provider), preferably from human resources,
-- appointed through the form sent by e-mail; the permission is personal
-- and may not be passed on; a change needs a written request; no second
-- officer is approved.
@ref akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_1/p2 akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_1/p3 akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_1/p4
@desc The person an owner names as its reporting officer.
DECLARE `reporting officer` HAS
    `an employee of the owner`    IS A BOOLEAN @desc in an employer-employee relationship with the owner, not a service provider
    `from human resources`        IS A BOOLEAN

GIVEN r IS A `reporting officer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be the reporting officer` r IF
    r's `an employee of the owner`

-- ¶5-¶6: the division checks the form and grants the permission; the
-- permission is personal and may not be passed on; no more than one
-- officer is approved. The text sets no time limit on either prohibition.
@ref akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_1/p5 akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_1/p6
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `one reporting officer, personally` IS
    (PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
     SHANT `appoint a second reporting officer`
     LEST BREACH BY `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ב/1 §א stage A: no more than one reporting officer is approved for an owner")
    RAND
    (PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
     SHANT `pass the reporting permission to another`
     LEST BREACH BY `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ב/1 §א stage A: the permission is personal and may not be passed to another contact")

-- Stage B (subpara 2 and, as the corpus numbers them, §§ג-ו): the owner
-- instructs its kindergarten teachers and health-profession teachers
-- employed from תשפ"א to open an online file on the teachers' portal, with
-- the questionnaire, declarations and documents.
@ref akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_2__cls_a akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_2__cls_b
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `having the teachers open files` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `instruct the teachers to open an online file`

-- ג: once the teacher has updated the request to open a file, the
-- reporting officer approves the file and verifies the attached documents
-- "true to the original".
@ref akn:art_c
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `approving the file` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `approve the file and verify the documents as true to the original`

-- ג ¶2: the officer also reports the institution code where the teacher is
-- placed — the cluster's code for a teacher in a kindergarten cluster.
@ref akn:art_c/p2
GIVEN `employed in a kindergarten cluster` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the institution code to report` `employed in a kindergarten cluster` IS
    IF `employed in a kindergarten cluster` THEN "the cluster's code" ELSE "the kindergarten's code"

-- ד: the file is opened in three stages, each in someone's charge.
@ref akn:art_d/p1 akn:art_d/p2 akn:art_d/p3 akn:art_d/p4 akn:art_d/p5
@desc The three stages of opening a file (§ד).
DECLARE `file stage` IS ONE OF
    `filling and sending the questionnaire with education and seniority documents`
    `approving the documents and the file and reporting the placement`
    `updating grade and seniority, approving documents and the file`

GIVEN s IS A `file stage`
GIVETH A Party
DECIDE `who is in charge of` s IS
    CONSIDER s
    WHEN `filling and sending the questionnaire with education and seniority documents` THEN `the teaching employee`
    WHEN `approving the documents and the file and reporting the placement` THEN `the local authority or owning body`
    WHEN `updating grade and seniority, approving documents and the file` THEN `the Ministry of Education`

-- akn:art_e Detailed instructions are on the teachers' portal and in a user guide; no rule.

-- ו: the owner has existing teachers check on the portal that their
-- education and seniority data are current; other updates go to the
-- district's teaching-staff unit in one of three ways.
@ref akn:art_f/p1 akn:art_f/p2 akn:art_f/p3 akn:art_f/p4 akn:art_f/p5
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `having existing teachers check their data` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `instruct the existing teachers to check their data on the portal`

@desc The three ways §ו allows for sending updated documents to the district.
DECLARE `way of updating` IS ONE OF
    `the teacher brings the originals at reception hours`
    `the teacher posts the originals`
    `the reporting officer e-mails copies certified true to the original`
    `another way`

GIVEN w IS A `way of updating`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an allowed way of updating` w IF
    CONSIDER w
    WHEN `another way` THEN FALSE
    OTHERWISE TRUE

-- akn:art_f/p6 akn:art_f/p7 Where to find which district an institution belongs to (annex ח), and the online trainings; no rule.

-- Stage C: the owner obtains an employment approval for every teaching
-- employee, under the circular on candidates for employment for תשפ"ב.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3/p1
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `obtaining employment approvals` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `obtain an employment approval`

-- Stage D: every owner — joined Ofek Hadash in תשפ"א or תשפ"ב or not —
-- reports the placement of every teaching employee, in or out of the
-- reform; instructions and trainings to follow.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4 akn:art_f__para_4/p2 akn:art_f__para_4/p3 akn:art_f__para_4/p4
GIVEN `joined Ofek Hadash` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the owner must report the positions` `joined Ofek Hadash` IF
    TRUE

-- Stage E: the profile is computed in the עוש"ר system, from the teachers'
-- characteristics and the owner's reports, once the earlier stages are done.
@ref akn:art_f__para_5/p1
GIVEN `files opened` IS A BOOLEAN, `employment approved` IS A BOOLEAN, `positions reported` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the profile can be computed` `files opened` `employment approved` `positions reported` IF
        `files opened`
    AND `employment approved`
    AND `positions reported`

§§ `ב. העסקה בתנאי אופק חדש — 1 מבוא`

-- akn:art_f__para_5__subpara_b The heading of part ב; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_5__subpara_b__cls_1 akn:art_f__para_5__subpara_b__cls_1/p2 akn:art_f__para_5__subpara_b__cls_1/p3 akn:art_f__para_5__subpara_b__cls_1/p4 akn:art_f__para_5__subpara_b__cls_1/p5 Background: the State's notice in HCJ 6677/19, the inter-ministerial team and its report; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_5__subpara_b__cls_1/p6 Background: Ofek Hadash terms were applied to these kindergartens from תשפ"א; the rules are encoded below.
-- akn:art_f__para_5__subpara_b__cls_1/p8 The chapter's purpose; no rule.

-- ¶7 (and §12.1): the Ministry alone approves joining, sets the grade and
-- converts the salary; as before, it sets the education rank and the
-- seniority.
@ref akn:art_f__para_5__subpara_b__cls_1/p7 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_12/p3
@desc The decisions ¶7 reserves to the Ministry.
DECLARE `reserved decision` IS ONE OF
    `approving a teaching employee's joining Ofek Hadash`
    `setting the Ofek Hadash grade`
    `converting the salary`
    `setting the education rank`
    `setting the seniority in teaching`

GIVEN d IS A `reserved decision`
GIVETH A Party
DECIDE `who decides` d IS
    `the Ministry of Education`

§§ `2 תחומי אחריות ביישום הרפורמה`

-- akn:art_f__para_5__subpara_b__cls_2 akn:art_f__para_2-1/p1 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1/p1 The headings "2 areas of responsibility", "2.1 first stage" and "2.1.1 actions by the owner"; no rule.

-- 2.1.1(1): until the Recognised Institutions Regulations are amended, the
-- owner commits to apply the reform; the text and annexes א-ב follow; it is
-- sent only through the portal, by 15.8.2021; annexes א-ב stay with the
-- owner for its management and the Ministry's later control.
@ref akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p2 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p3 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p4 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p6
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `submitting the commitment to join` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `submit the commitment to join Ofek Hadash through the portal`
    WITHIN `15 August 2021`
    LEST BREACH BY `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ב/1 §2.1.1: the commitment to join Ofek Hadash for תשפ\"ב is due by 15.8.2021"

-- ¶5: annexes א and ב are not sent to the Ministry but kept by the owner
-- for its management and the Ministry's later control.
@ref akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p5
@desc The documents of the joining, by where they are kept.
DECLARE `joining document` IS ONE OF
    `the owner's commitment`
    `annex א, the letter to the teacher`
    `annex ב, the teacher's acknowledgement`

GIVEN d IS A `joining document`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `sent to the Ministry` d IF
    CONSIDER d
    WHEN `the owner's commitment` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

-- 2.1.1(2)-(4), which the corpus prints inside item 1: opening files (part
-- א), identifying the teachers who meet the conditions (§3), and reporting
-- every teacher's position, in or out of the reform; instructions follow.
@ref akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p7 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p8 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p9 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p10 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p11 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p12 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p13
GIVEN t IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the owner identifies the teacher as meeting the conditions` t IF
    `joins Ofek Hadash` t

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `the owner's further first-stage steps` IS
    (PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
     MUST  `instruct the teachers to open an online file`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
     MUST  `report the teachers' positions`)

-- 2.1.1(5): teachers who meet the conditions work the Ofek Hadash week and
-- are paid Ofek Hadash salary, by the advance until the grade is set.
-- F-2021-22_tashpab_01-a: "(כפי שיפורט להלן בסעיף 12)" — the advances are
-- §13; §12 is the grade.
@ref akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_5 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_5/p2
GIVEN t IS A `kindergarten teacher`, `the grade has been set` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `how the teacher is paid` t `the grade has been set` IS
    IF (NOT `joins Ofek Hadash` t)
    THEN "pre-reform terms"
    ELSE IF `the grade has been set`
         THEN "Ofek Hadash salary by the grade"
         ELSE "the current salary and the Ofek Hadash advance"

-- 2.1.1(6)-(7): the school day ends at the Ofek Hadash hour of §4.1.4, and
-- the timetable follows the Ofek Hadash week.
@ref akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_6 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_7
GIVEN k IS A `kindergarten kind`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the day the owner must run, Sunday to Thursday, ends at` k IS
    `end of day Sunday to Thursday` k

-- 2.1.1(8)-(9): the owner sends the Ministry's contractor (Unique) the
-- salary interface for the month asked for; once the grade is set and
-- reported through the contractor, the owner pays by the grade from the
-- joining date and deducts the advances (F-2021-22_tashpab_01-a: "כאמור
-- בסעיף 12 להלן").
@ref akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_8 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_9
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `sending the salary interface` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `send the salary interface to the Ministry's contractor`

GIVEN `the grade has been set` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `paying by the grade` `the grade has been set` IS
    IF `the grade has been set`
    THEN PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
         MUST  `pay salary by the Ofek Hadash grade and deduct the advances`
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- 2.1.2: the Ministry approves owners that signed in time and joins their
-- kindergartens; handles exceptional joining (§3.2.1) and leaving (§3.6);
-- checks each teacher, sets the grade, computes the profile, and reimburses
-- the owner for teachers on the Ofek week and pay, net of the advances.
@ref akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_1 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_2 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_3 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_4 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_4__pnt_a akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_4__pnt_b akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_4__pnt_c
GIVEN `signed the commitment in time` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the Ministry joins the owner's kindergartens` `signed the commitment in time` IF
    `signed the commitment in time`

GIVEN `cost of the Ofek teachers` IS A NUMBER, `advances paid` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the reimbursement for the reform` `cost of the Ofek teachers` `advances paid` IS
    `cost of the Ofek teachers` MINUS `advances paid`

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `the Ministry's first-stage duties` IS
    (PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
     MUST  `hear the exception requests`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
     MUST  `hear the requests to leave`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
     MUST  `check each teacher's joining conditions`
     HENCE ((PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
             MUST  `set the Ofek Hadash grade`)
            RAND
            (PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
             MUST  `compute the Ofek Hadash profile`)
            RAND
            (PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
             MUST  `reimburse the owner net of the advances`)))

§§ `3 תנאי ההצטרפות`

-- akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_4__pnt_c__pnt_3 akn:art_f__para_3-1/p1 The headings "3 conditions of joining" and "3.1 definitions"; no rule.

@desc A teaching employee of the owner's kindergartens, as far as this circular asks about it.
DECLARE `kindergarten teacher` HAS
    `years of recognised actual teaching`         IS A NUMBER  @desc seniority recognised for actual teaching; an internship year, military or national service in teaching does not count (section 3.1.1)
    `years of seniority`                          IS A NUMBER  @desc seniority in teaching for salary
    `academic`                                    IS A BOOLEAN @desc section 3.1.3
    `certified to teach`                          IS A BOOLEAN @desc section 3.1.4
    `position fraction`                           IS A NUMBER
    `kindergarten joined Ofek Hadash`             IS A BOOLEAN
    `signed the commitment to complete a degree`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `approved by the exceptions committee`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `an intern`                                   IS A BOOLEAN

`a third of a position` MEANS 1 DIVIDED BY 3

-- 3.1.1: a new teaching employee has no years of seniority recognised for
-- actual teaching, from an employer outside the civil service or in it (an
-- internship year, military or national service in teaching not counting).
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-1__subpara_3-1-1
GIVEN t IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a new teaching employee` t IF
    t's `years of recognised actual teaching` EQUALS 0

@ref akn:art_f__para_3-1__subpara_3-1-2
GIVEN t IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an existing teaching employee` t IF
    t's `years of recognised actual teaching` GREATER THAN 0

-- 3.1.3: an Israeli degree, a foreign degree the Ministry's evaluation
-- department recognised, or a salary grade the teaching-staff division
-- approved as equivalent.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-1__subpara_3-1-3
GIVEN `Israeli academic degree` IS A BOOLEAN, `recognised foreign degree` IS A BOOLEAN, `approved equivalent salary grade` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an academic teaching employee` `Israeli academic degree` `recognised foreign degree` `approved equivalent salary grade` IF
        `Israeli academic degree`
    OR  `recognised foreign degree`
    OR  `approved equivalent salary grade`

-- 3.1.4: a teaching certificate, or certification another way under the
-- Ministry's instructions.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-1__subpara_3-1-4
GIVEN `teaching certificate` IS A BOOLEAN, `certified another way under the Ministry's instructions` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `certified to teach under section 3.1.4` `teaching certificate` `certified another way under the Ministry's instructions` IF
        `teaching certificate`
    OR  `certified another way under the Ministry's instructions`

-- akn:art_f__para_3-2/p1 The heading "3.2 conditions of joining for existing teachers"; no rule.

-- 3.2.1: an existing academic joins when certified and at a third of a
-- position or more; one without certification may ask the exceptions
-- committee through the owner (annex ד), by 31.12.2021. The committee's
-- approval is read as standing in for the certificate only.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1 akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p2 akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p3 akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p4 akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p5 akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p6 akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p7
GIVEN t IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an existing academic teacher joins` t IF
        `an existing teaching employee` t
    AND t's `academic`
    AND t's `position fraction` AT LEAST `a third of a position`
    AND (t's `certified to teach` OR t's `approved by the exceptions committee`)

@ref akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p8
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `asking the exceptions committee` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MAY   `submit a request to the exceptions committee`
    WITHIN `31 December 2021`

-- ¶9-10: uncertified and below 25 years: no promotion until certified;
-- the work period and part of the studies count "כמפורט בסעיף 12.2.2".
-- F-2021-22_tashpab_01-b: there is no §12.2.2 in this circular; the rule is
-- §10.2.2.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p9 akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p10
GIVEN t IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `barred from promotion until certified under section 3.2.1` t IF
        (NOT t's `certified to teach`)
    AND t's `years of seniority` LESS THAN 25

-- akn:art_f__para_3-3/p1 The heading "3.3 existing non-academic teachers"; no rule.

-- 3.3.1-3.3.2: up to 27 years (27 included): joins only after signing the
-- commitment to complete a degree within 4 years of signing (annex ג),
-- submitted by the owner through the portal by 31.12.2021; 28 years or
-- more: joins without it.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-3__subpara_3-3-1 akn:art_f__para_3-3__subpara_3-3-1/p2 akn:art_f__para_3-3__subpara_3-3-1/p3 akn:art_f__para_3-3__subpara_3-3-2
GIVEN t IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an existing non-academic teacher joins` t IF
        `an existing teaching employee` t
    AND (NOT t's `academic`)
    AND (t's `years of seniority` AT LEAST 28 OR t's `signed the commitment to complete a degree`)

@ref akn:art_f__para_3-3__subpara_3-3-1/p4
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `submitting the degree commitments` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MAY   `submit the commitment to complete a degree`
    WITHIN `31 December 2021`

@ref akn:art_f__para_3-3__subpara_3-3-3
GIVEN t IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the owner must follow up the commitment` t IF
        t's `signed the commitment to complete a degree`
    AND (NOT t's `academic`)

-- 3.3.4: a degree within 4 years of joining: the difference retroactively
-- from joining; later: the academic table without arrears.
-- F-2021-22_tashpab_01-e: 3.3.1 counts the 4 years from signing.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-3__subpara_3-3-4
GIVEN `months from joining to the degree` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `arrears from joining under section 3.3.4` `months from joining to the degree` IF
    `months from joining to the degree` AT MOST 48

-- 3.4: a new academic in a kindergarten that joined joins when certified and
-- at a third of a position or more. (The exceptions committee of 3.2.1 is
-- for existing teachers; 3.4 names none.)
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-4/p1 akn:art_f__para_3-4/p2 akn:art_f__para_3-4/p3 akn:art_f__para_3-4/p4
GIVEN t IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a new teacher joins` t IF
        `a new teaching employee` t
    AND t's `academic`
    AND t's `position fraction` AT LEAST `a third of a position`
    AND t's `certified to teach`

-- akn:art_f__para_3-5/p1 The heading "3.5 interns"; no rule.

-- 3.5.1: interns in a kindergarten that joined are employed only under the
-- reform; the year counts only if the intern actually works a third of a
-- position or more for at least six months of the year, July and August
-- not counted.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-5__subpara_3-5-1
GIVEN t IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an intern is employed only under the reform` t IF
    t's `an intern` AND t's `kindergarten joined Ofek Hadash`

GIVEN `months at a third or more, September to June` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the internship year is recognised` `months at a third or more, September to June` IF
    `months at a third or more, September to June` AT LEAST 6

-- 3.5.2: at most two school years, in which the degree and the certificate
-- are completed, or no further employment under the reform.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-5__subpara_3-5-2
GIVEN `school years of internship` IS A NUMBER, `completed the degree and the certificate` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the intern may go on under the reform` `school years of internship` `completed the degree and the certificate` IF
        `school years of internship` AT MOST 2
    OR  `completed the degree and the certificate`

-- 3.5.3: the internship does not count for salary seniority or the minimum
-- period for promotion; it counts for tenure, the jubilee grant and the
-- recuperation allowance.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-5__subpara_3-5-3
@desc The kinds of seniority §3.5.3 names.
DECLARE `seniority purpose` IS ONE OF
    `seniority for salary`
    `the minimum period for promotion`
    `seniority for tenure`
    `seniority for the jubilee grant`
    `seniority for the recuperation allowance`

GIVEN p IS A `seniority purpose`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the internship counts for` p IF
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN `seniority for salary` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `the minimum period for promotion` THEN FALSE
    OTHERWISE TRUE

-- akn:art_f__para_3-6/p1 The heading "3.6 leaving Ofek Hadash"; no rule.

-- 3.6: everyone meeting the conditions must join; exceptionally a request to
-- leave may be heard for health (the teacher's or a first-degree
-- relative's, with current medical papers) or personal reasons (a change
-- for the worse since joining), on annex ה's form, through the owner and
-- the portal, by 31.12.2021.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-1 akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-2 akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-2/p2 akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-2/p3 akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-2/p4 akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-3
@desc The grounds §3.6.2 names.
DECLARE `ground for leaving` IS ONE OF
    `health of the teacher or a first-degree relative, with current medical papers`
    `a change for the worse in personal or family circumstances since joining`
    `another ground`

GIVEN g IS A `ground for leaving`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a request to leave may be heard` g IF
    CONSIDER g
    WHEN `another ground` THEN FALSE
    OTHERWISE TRUE

@ref akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-4 akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-4/p2 akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-5
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `asking to leave the reform` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MAY   `submit a request to leave Ofek Hadash`
    WITHIN `31 December 2021`

-- 3.7: a substitute on weekly hours (not single or effective hours) is
-- employed on the characteristics of the teacher she replaces.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-7/p1 akn:art_f__para_3-7/p2
GIVEN `employed on weekly hours` IS A BOOLEAN, `replaced teacher in the reform` IS A BOOLEAN, `otherwise in the reform` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the substitute is employed in the reform` `employed on weekly hours` `replaced teacher in the reform` `otherwise in the reform` IS
    IF `employed on weekly hours` THEN `replaced teacher in the reform` ELSE `otherwise in the reform`

§§ `3 Who joins (3.2-3.5 together)`

GIVEN t IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `joins Ofek Hadash` t IF
        t's `kindergarten joined Ofek Hadash`
    AND (   `an intern is employed only under the reform` t
         OR `a new teacher joins` t
         OR `an existing academic teacher joins` t
         OR `an existing non-academic teacher joins` t)

§§ `4 מבנה שבוע העבודה`

-- akn:art_f__para_3-7__subpara_4 akn:art_f__para_4-1/p1 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p1 The headings "4 the work week", "4.1 the kindergarten teacher's week" and "4.1.1 the base of the position"; no rule.

@desc The posts §4.1.1's table distinguishes.
DECLARE `kindergarten post` IS ONE OF
    `a kindergarten head teacher`
    `a complementary kindergarten teacher`
    `a kindergarten cluster manager`

@desc The age bands of §4.1.1's table.
DECLARE `age band` IS ONE OF
    `under 50`
    `50 to 55, 55 not included`
    `55 and over, a new teacher`
    `55 and over, an existing teacher`

-- 4.1.1: the base of a full position by post and age band.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/t1 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p2 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p3 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p4 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p6
GIVEN p IS A `kindergarten post`, b IS AN `age band`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the base of the position` p b IS
    CONSIDER b
    WHEN `under 50` THEN `base by post` p 30.4 33.8 34
    WHEN `50 to 55, 55 not included` THEN `base by post` p 28.4 31.8 32
    WHEN `55 and over, a new teacher` THEN `base by post` p 28.4 31.8 32
    WHEN `55 and over, an existing teacher` THEN `base by post` p 26.4 29.8 30

GIVEN p IS A `kindergarten post`, `head teacher's` IS A NUMBER, `complementary teacher's` IS A NUMBER, `cluster manager's` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `base by post` p `head teacher's` `complementary teacher's` `cluster manager's` IS
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN `a kindergarten head teacher` THEN `head teacher's`
    WHEN `a complementary kindergarten teacher` THEN `complementary teacher's`
    WHEN `a kindergarten cluster manager` THEN `cluster manager's`

GIVEN age IS A NUMBER, existing IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `age band`
DECIDE `the age band of` age existing IS
    IF age LESS THAN 50
    THEN `under 50`
    ELSE IF age LESS THAN 55
         THEN `50 to 55, 55 not included`
         ELSE IF existing
              THEN `55 and over, an existing teacher`
              ELSE `55 and over, a new teacher`

-- ¶5: "וראה בהרחבה לעניין גננת הזכאית לשעות גיל בסעיף 7 להלן".
-- F-2021-22_tashpab_01-c: §7 is "a mother teacher"; the age hours are §8.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p5
@desc The numbered chapters of part ב, as the circular prints them.
DECLARE `chapter of part ב` HAS
    `chapter number`  IS A NUMBER
    `chapter subject` IS A STRING

`the chapters of part ב` MEANS
    LIST `chapter of part ב` 1  "introduction",
         `chapter of part ב` 2  "areas of responsibility",
         `chapter of part ב` 3  "conditions of joining",
         `chapter of part ב` 4  "the work week",
         `chapter of part ב` 5  "part-time employment",
         `chapter of part ב` 6  "employment above 100%",
         `chapter of part ב` 7  "a mother teacher",
         `chapter of part ב` 8  "age hours",
         `chapter of part ב` 9  "kindergarten activity hours",
         `chapter of part ב` 10 "promotion",
         `chapter of part ב` 11 "role bonuses",
         `chapter of part ב` 12 "setting the grade",
         `chapter of part ב` 13 "salary advances",
         `chapter of part ב` 14 "the agreements prevail"

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF STRING
DECIDE `the subject of chapter` n IS
    map (GIVEN c YIELD c's `chapter subject`) (filter (GIVEN c YIELD c's `chapter number` EQUALS n) `the chapters of part ב`)

`the age-hours pointer reaches the mother chapter` MEANS
    `the subject of chapter` 7 EQUALS LIST "a mother teacher"
#ASSERT `the age-hours pointer reaches the mother chapter`

-- F-2021-22_tashpab_01-a: §2.1.1(5) and (9) send the advances to "סעיף 12",
-- which is the grade; the advances are §13.
`the advances pointer reaches the grade chapter` MEANS
        `the subject of chapter` 12 EQUALS LIST "setting the grade"
    AND `the subject of chapter` 13 EQUALS LIST "salary advances"
#ASSERT `the advances pointer reaches the grade chapter`

-- F-2021-22_tashpab_01-b: §3.2.1 ¶10 sends the recognition of the work
-- period and the studies to "סעיף 12.2.2"; §12 prints paragraphs 12.1-12.6
-- only, and the rule is §10.2.2.
`the paragraphs of chapter 12` MEANS
    LIST "12.1", "12.2", "12.3", "12.4", "12.5", "12.6"

`section 12.2.2 is not in the circular` MEANS
        NOT (elem "12.2.2" `the paragraphs of chapter 12`)
    AND `the subject of chapter` 10 EQUALS LIST "promotion"
#ASSERT `section 12.2.2 is not in the circular`

-- 4.1.2: the head teacher's and the complementary teacher's positions are
-- frontal hours only; the cluster manager's 34 hours split between frontal
-- (or enrichment or reinforcement) hours and management by the number of
-- kindergartens.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/p2 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/p3
GIVEN p IS A `kindergarten post`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the position is frontal hours only` p IF
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN `a kindergarten cluster manager` THEN FALSE
    OTHERWISE TRUE

-- 4.1.2's table: the cluster manager's 34 hours by the number of
-- kindergartens in the cluster, one row per printed line.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/p4 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/p5 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/p6 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/p7 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/p8 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/t1
@desc A row of §4.1.2's table: the kindergartens in the cluster, frontal hours, management hours, total.
DECLARE `cluster row` HAS
    `lowest number of kindergartens`  IS A NUMBER
    `highest number of kindergartens` IS A NUMBER
    `cluster frontal hours`           IS A NUMBER
    `cluster management hours`        IS A NUMBER
    `cluster total hours`             IS A NUMBER

`the cluster manager's week` MEANS
    LIST `cluster row` 4 4 22 12 34, `cluster row` 5 5 19 15 34, `cluster row` 6 6 16 18 34,
         `cluster row` 7 7 13 21 34, `cluster row` 8 8 10 24 34, `cluster row` 9 9 7 27 34,
         `cluster row` 10 11 4 30 34

#ASSERT all (GIVEN r YIELD r's `cluster frontal hours` PLUS r's `cluster management hours` EQUALS r's `cluster total hours`) `the cluster manager's week`

-- 4.1.3: work starts at 7:55.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-3
`the working day starts at` MEANS 7 TIMES 60 PLUS 55

-- 4.1.4: the end of the school day by the kindergarten's kind of
-- disability, Sunday-Thursday and Friday; a kindergarten that ended at
-- 16:00 or 16:45 before the reform keeps its day and the teacher adds forty
-- minutes in overlap.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p2 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p3 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p4 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p5 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p6 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p7 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p8 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p9 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p10 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p11 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p12 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p13
@desc The kinds of special-education kindergarten §4.1.4 lists.
DECLARE `kindergarten kind` IS ONE OF
    `physical disability`
    `deaf and hard of hearing`
    `blind and visually impaired`
    `moderate intellectual disability`
    `moderate complex intellectual disability`
    `severe or profound intellectual disability, nursing`
    `autism`
    `severe mental disorders`
    `mild intellectual disability`
    `every other kind of class`

GIVEN k IS A `kindergarten kind`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `end of day Sunday to Thursday` k IS
    CONSIDER k
    WHEN `autism` THEN 16 TIMES 60 PLUS 45
    WHEN `severe mental disorders` THEN 16 TIMES 60
    WHEN `every other kind of class` THEN 14 TIMES 60
    OTHERWISE 15 TIMES 60 PLUS 10

`end of day on Friday` MEANS 12 TIMES 60 PLUS 45

@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p14
GIVEN `ended at 16:00 or 16:45 before the reform` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `minutes the teacher adds in overlap` `ended at 16:00 or 16:45 before the reform` IS
    IF `ended at 16:00 or 16:45 before the reform` THEN 40 ELSE 0

-- ¶15-16: a day ending at 14:00 is a working day of 6.08 hours, and so in
-- proportion for the other end hours.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p15 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p16
GIVEN `end of day in minutes` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `hours in the working day` `end of day in minutes` IS
    TRUNC ((`end of day in minutes` MINUS `the working day starts at`) DIVIDED BY 60) 2

#ASSERT `hours in the working day` (`end of day Sunday to Thursday` `every other kind of class`) EQUALS 6.08

-- 4.1.5: the extent of the position is the weekly hours over the base.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-5 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-5/p2
GIVEN `weekly hours` IS A NUMBER, `base` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the extent of the position` `weekly hours` `base` IS
    `weekly hours` DIVIDED BY `base`

-- 4.2: a health or arts therapist works 36 hours: 26 frontal, 3 individual
-- (content set with the head of the setting by the Ministry's guidance),
-- and 7 stay hours in the kindergarten on the activities listed.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-2 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_a akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_b akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c
@desc A weekly structure of work: total, frontal, individual and stay hours.
DECLARE `work week` HAS
    `weekly hours`     IS A NUMBER
    `frontal hours`    IS A NUMBER
    `individual hours` IS A NUMBER
    `stay hours`       IS A NUMBER

`the therapist's week` MEANS `work week` 36 26 3 7

#ASSERT `the therapist's week`'s `frontal hours` PLUS `the therapist's week`'s `individual hours` PLUS `the therapist's week`'s `stay hours` EQUALS 36

-- 4.2ג ¶2-¶12: the activities of the stay hours, and the link to the
-- detailed week (the same as in a primary school).
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p2 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p3 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p4 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p5 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p6 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p7 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p8 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p9 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p10 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p11 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p12
@desc The activities §4.2ג lists for the stay hours.
DECLARE `stay activity` IS ONE OF
    `adapting the curriculum and the environment to the pupil`
    `individual meetings with parents`
    `preparing for and taking part in committees`
    `planning and guiding the special-education assistants`
    `coordinating with outside bodies for the pupil's inclusion`
    `coordinating for educational continuity`

GIVEN a IS A `stay activity`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a stay hour may be spent on` a IF
    TRUE

§§ `5 העסקה בחלקיות משרה ברפורמה`

-- akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c__cls_5 The heading "5 part-time employment"; no rule.

-- 5.1: an existing kindergarten teacher under the reform at no less than a
-- third; 5.2: a new one not below a third unless the head of the division
-- approved the employment and its week; 5.3: a complementary teacher works
-- under the reform only when her total in reform kindergartens is a third
-- or more, then in those kindergartens only; 5.4: a health professional may
-- work below a third.
@ref akn:art_f__para_5-1 akn:art_f__para_5-2 akn:art_f__para_5-3 akn:art_f__para_5-4
@desc A kindergarten teacher's or therapist's part-time facts.
DECLARE `part-time employee` HAS
    `a health or arts therapist`               IS A BOOLEAN
    `existing`                                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `a complementary teacher`                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `fraction in reform kindergartens`         IS A NUMBER
    `approved by the head of the division`     IS A BOOLEAN

GIVEN e IS A `part-time employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be employed under the reform at that fraction` e IF
        e's `a health or arts therapist`
    OR  e's `fraction in reform kindergartens` AT LEAST `a third of a position`
    OR ((NOT e's `existing`) AND (NOT e's `a complementary teacher`) AND e's `approved by the head of the division`)

-- 5.5: a therapist's part-time position is cut from each kind of hour in
-- proportion; below a third, only frontal hours, the position being their
-- share of the base.
@ref akn:art_f__para_5-5
GIVEN w IS A `work week`, f IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `work week`
DECIDE `the part-time week` w f IS
    `work week` (w's `weekly hours` TIMES f) (w's `frontal hours` TIMES f) (w's `individual hours` TIMES f) (w's `stay hours` TIMES f)

-- 5.5 ¶2-¶3: a health professional below a third works frontal hours
-- only, no individual or stay hours; the position is the ratio of those
-- frontal hours to the base.
@ref akn:art_f__para_5-5/p2 akn:art_f__para_5-5/p3
GIVEN `frontal hours` IS A NUMBER, `base` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `work week`
DECIDE `the week below a third` `frontal hours` `base` IS
    `work week` `frontal hours` `frontal hours` 0 0

GIVEN `frontal hours` IS A NUMBER, `base` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position below a third` `frontal hours` `base` IS
    `frontal hours` DIVIDED BY `base`

-- 5.6: below a third under the reform, the period does not count toward the
-- required period (פז"נ) for promotion.
@ref akn:art_f__para_5-6
GIVEN f IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the period counts toward promotion` f IF
    f AT LEAST `a third of a position`

§§ `6 העסקה מעל 100% משרה ברפורמה`

-- 6: kindergarten teachers may be placed up to 126% and never above 42 hours
-- a week; above 126% (or a health professional above 117%) goes to the
-- division by e-mail, by the procedure for employment above 100%.
@ref akn:art_f__para_5-6__subpara_6 akn:art_f__para_5-6__subpara_6/p2 akn:art_f__para_5-6__subpara_6/p3 akn:art_f__para_5-6__subpara_6/p4
GIVEN `a health professional` IS A BOOLEAN, `total position` IS A NUMBER, `hours a week` IS A NUMBER, `approved by the division` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the placement above 100% is allowed` `a health professional` `total position` `hours a week` `approved by the division` IF
        `hours a week` AT MOST 42
    AND (`total position` AT MOST (IF `a health professional` THEN 1.17 ELSE 1.26) OR `approved by the division`)

§§ `7 עובד הוראה אם`

-- akn:art_f__para_5-6__subpara_7 The heading "7 a mother teacher"; no rule.

-- 7.1: by the takanon: a mother of a child under 14 employed at 79% or more.
@ref akn:art_f__para_7-1
GIVEN `position fraction` IS A NUMBER, `mother of a child under 14` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to a mother's position` `position fraction` `mother of a child under 14` IF
        `mother of a child under 14`
    AND `position fraction` AT LEAST 0.79

-- 7.2(א): a mother kindergarten teacher may be absent a whole day every
-- other week or half a day every week, pay and position unchanged; (ב) one
-- who, by consent and for the system's needs, is never absent all year gets
-- 10% more position that year, even above 100%.
@ref akn:art_f__para_7-2/p1 akn:art_f__para_7-2__subpara_a akn:art_f__para_7-2__subpara_b akn:art_f__para_7-2__subpara_b/p2
@desc The absences 7.2(א) allows a mother kindergarten teacher, pay and position uncut.
DECLARE `a mother's absence` IS ONE OF
    `a whole working day once every two weeks`
    `half a working day once a week`

GIVEN `position fraction` IS A NUMBER, `took no absences all year` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a mother kindergarten teacher's position` `position fraction` `took no absences all year` IS
    IF `took no absences all year` THEN `position fraction` PLUS 0.10 ELSE `position fraction`

-- 7.3: a mother therapist works the regular reform week by the linked table.
@ref akn:art_f__para_7-3 akn:art_f__para_7-3/p2 akn:art_f__para_7-3/p3 akn:art_f__para_7-3/p4
GIVEN `the mother's week in the linked table` IS A `work week` @desc the week the linked Ofek Hadash table sets for a mother therapist
GIVETH A `work week`
DECIDE `a mother therapist's week` `the mother's week in the linked table` IS
    `the mother's week in the linked table`

-- 7.4: after maternity leave, at 90% or more: for four months an hour a day
-- (five a week) off the STAY hours, pay and position unchanged; §§7.2-7.3
-- do not apply meanwhile, and never both at once.
-- F-2021-22_tashpab_01-f: a kindergarten teacher's position is frontal
-- hours only (§4.1.2), so she has no stay hours to take the hour from.
@ref akn:art_f__para_7-4 akn:art_f__para_7-4/p2
GIVEN `position fraction` IS A NUMBER, `months since the maternity leave ended` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the nursing hour` `position fraction` `months since the maternity leave ended` IF
        `position fraction` AT LEAST 0.90
    AND `months since the maternity leave ended` LESS THAN 4

-- §4.1.2 gives the head and the complementary teacher frontal hours only,
-- and the cluster manager frontal and management hours: no kindergarten
-- post has stay hours.
GIVEN p IS A `kindergarten post`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `stay hours of a full position` p IS
    0

`a kindergarten head teacher has no stay hours to reduce` MEANS
        `entitled to the nursing hour` 1 1
    AND `stay hours of a full position` `a kindergarten head teacher` LESS THAN 5
#ASSERT `a kindergarten head teacher has no stay hours to reduce`

-- The reading adopted: for a kindergarten teacher, whose hours are all
-- frontal, the nursing hour comes off her working hours.
GIVEN p IS A `kindergarten post`, `weekly hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `weekly hours during the nursing months` p `weekly hours` IS
    `weekly hours` MINUS 5

§§ `8 זכאות לשעות גיל`

-- akn:art_f__para_7-4__subpara_8 The heading "8 age hours"; no rule.

-- 8.1: set at the start of the year by the age on 31 December of that
-- school year, for the whole year.
@ref akn:art_f__para_8-1
GIVEN `age on 31 December of the school year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the age for age hours` `age on 31 December of the school year` IS
    `age on 31 December of the school year`

-- 8.3-8.5: an existing teacher of 50-55 two frontal hours off the base,
-- of 55 and over four; a new teacher of 50 and over two, and no more at
-- 55; the position unchanged. (§4.1.1's table reads 50-55 "not included",
-- so 8.3 and 8.4 do not overlap.)
@ref akn:art_f__para_8-3 akn:art_f__para_8-4 akn:art_f__para_8-5
GIVEN age IS A NUMBER, existing IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `hours off the base for age` age existing IS
    IF age LESS THAN 50
    THEN 0
    ELSE IF age LESS THAN 55
         THEN 2
         ELSE IF existing
              THEN 4
              ELSE 2

-- The table of §4.1.1 is the base less these hours.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN a YIELD `the base of the position` `a kindergarten head teacher` (`the age band of` a TRUE) EQUALS 30.4 MINUS `hours off the base for age` a TRUE) (LIST 40, 50, 54, 55, 60)
#ASSERT all (GIVEN a YIELD `the base of the position` `a complementary kindergarten teacher` (`the age band of` a FALSE) EQUALS 33.8 MINUS `hours off the base for age` a FALSE) (LIST 40, 50, 54, 55, 60)

-- 8.2: a kindergarten teacher of 50 or more in a part position gets a
-- PARTIAL reduction, "by the rules detailed below and by the reform's work
-- week". The rules below (8.3-8.5) give whole-position figures only. The
-- reading adopted (F-2021-22_tashpab_01-j): in proportion to the position,
-- up to one full position.
@ref akn:art_f__para_8-2
GIVEN age IS A NUMBER, existing IS A BOOLEAN, `position fraction` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `hours off a part position for age` age existing `position fraction` IS
    `hours off the base for age` age existing TIMES min `position fraction` 1

-- F-2021-22_tashpab_01-j: the rules 8.2 points to give a half-position
-- teacher the hours of a full one.
`8.3-8.5 give no part-position measure` MEANS
    `hours off the base for age` 52 TRUE EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `8.3-8.5 give no part-position measure`

-- 8.6: the therapists' age rules are those of the linked week tables (an input).
@ref akn:art_f__para_8-6 akn:art_f__para_8-6/p2 akn:art_f__para_8-6/p3
GIVEN `hours off by the linked tables` IS A NUMBER @desc the therapist's age reduction under the linked Ofek Hadash week tables
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a therapist's hours off for age` `hours off by the linked tables` IS
    `hours off by the linked tables`

§§ `9 שעות פעילות גן`

-- 9.1-9.2: a teaching employee on the reform, at any position, is paid for
-- kindergarten activities on top of the position and fixed salary; the
-- hours are allocated by the kindergarten's needs, never more than 18 to a
-- teacher in a half-year.
@ref akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p2 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p3 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p4 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p5
GIVEN `employed under the reform` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `paid for kindergarten activities on top of the salary` `employed under the reform` IF
    `employed under the reform`

`activity hours a half-year, at most` MEANS 18

-- 9.3: a kindergarten teacher's are for staff meetings, individual parent
-- meetings and after-hours events; 9.4: a therapist's for general
-- meetings, individual parent meetings and after-hours events.
@ref akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p6 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p7 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p8 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p9 akn:art_f__para_9-4 akn:art_f__para_9-4/p2 akn:art_f__para_9-4/p3 akn:art_f__para_9-4/p4
@desc The purposes §§9.3-9.4 list.
DECLARE `activity purpose` IS ONE OF
    `staff meetings`
    `general meetings`
    `individual parents' and children's meetings`
    `an after-hours activity`
    `another purpose`

GIVEN `a therapist` IS A BOOLEAN, p IS AN `activity purpose`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `activity hours may serve` `a therapist` p IF
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN `staff meetings` THEN (NOT `a therapist`)
    WHEN `general meetings` THEN `a therapist`
    WHEN `another purpose` THEN FALSE
    OTHERWISE TRUE

§§ `10 קידום בדרגות`

@desc A promotion step: from grade, required months, development hours, and the supplement to the table salary.
DECLARE `promotion step` HAS
    `from grade`                 IS A NUMBER
    `required months`            IS A NUMBER
    `development hours`          IS A NUMBER
    `supplement to table salary` IS A NUMBER

-- 10.1: the required period (פז"נ), development hours (שפ"מ) and an
-- evaluation, by the Ministry's guidance and links.
@ref akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p2 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p3 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p4 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p5 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p6 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p7 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p8 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p9 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p10 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p11 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p12 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p13
GIVEN s IS A `promotion step`, months IS A NUMBER, hours IS A NUMBER, `evaluation passed` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the step is earned` s months hours `evaluation passed` IF
        months AT LEAST s's `required months`
    AND hours AT LEAST s's `development hours`
    AND `evaluation passed`

-- 10.2.1: certified academics.
@ref akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p14 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p15 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p16 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/t1
`promotion of certified academics` MEANS
    LIST `promotion step` 1 30 120 0.075, `promotion step` 2 30 120 0.075,
         `promotion step` 3 36 180 0.075, `promotion step` 4 36 180 0.075,
         `promotion step` 5 36 180 0.075, `promotion step` 6 48 210 0.075,
         `promotion step` 7 48 210 0.075, `promotion step` 8 48 210 0.075

-- 10.2.2 (its number is printed in the last row of the table above):
-- uncertified academics. "עד 25 שנה" who joined by exception: no promotion
-- until certified, then the period and hours count from joining for one
-- promotion, and up to 60 study hours count; "25 שנה ומעלה": no
-- certificate needed; new teachers by exception: no promotion until
-- certified, counting from certification.
@ref akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p17 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p18 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p19 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p20 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p21 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p22
GIVEN `years of seniority` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF STRING
DECIDE `what section 10.2.2 says of an uncertified veteran` `years of seniority` IS
    append (IF `years of seniority` AT MOST 25 THEN LIST "no promotion until certified" ELSE EMPTY)
           (IF `years of seniority` AT LEAST 25 THEN LIST "promoted without a certificate" ELSE EMPTY)

`study hours that may count as development hours, at most` MEANS 60

-- F-2021-22_tashpab_01-d: at exactly 25 years 10.2.2 says both.
`at 25 years section 10.2.2 gives both answers` MEANS
    count (`what section 10.2.2 says of an uncertified veteran` 25) EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `at 25 years section 10.2.2 gives both answers`

-- The reading adopted: §3.2.1's "below 25" — 25 years need no certificate.
GIVEN `years of seniority` IS A NUMBER, `certified to teach` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an academic may be promoted` `years of seniority` `certified to teach` IF
        `certified to teach`
    OR  `years of seniority` AT LEAST 25

-- 10.2.3: certified non-academics. Up to 27 years: the commitment of §3.3
-- and no promotion until the degree; 28 years or more: no degree, the
-- slower table.
@ref akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p23 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p24 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p25 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p26 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/t2
`promotion of non-academics with 28 years` MEANS
    LIST `promotion step` 1 48 480 0.075, `promotion step` 2 48 480 0.075,
         `promotion step` 3 48 480 0.075, `promotion step` 4 48 480 0.075,
         `promotion step` 5 48 480 0.075, `promotion step` 6 48 480 0.075,
         `promotion step` 7 48 480 0.075, `promotion step` 8 48 480 0.075

GIVEN `years of seniority` IS A NUMBER, `completed the degree` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a non-academic may be promoted` `years of seniority` `completed the degree` IF
        `completed the degree`
    OR  `years of seniority` AT LEAST 28

§§ `11 גמולים לגננות לפי תפקידן`

-- akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11/p2 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11/p3 The headings "11 role bonuses", "a kindergarten head teacher" and "a management bonus as follows"; no rule.

-- 11(1): the head teacher's management bonus: a new teacher by grade, an
-- existing one by seniority in management.
@ref akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_1 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_1/p2 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_1/p3 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_1/p4 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_1/p5 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_1/p6 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_1/p7
GIVEN `a new teacher` IS A BOOLEAN, `grade` IS A NUMBER, `years in management` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the head teacher's management bonus rate` `a new teacher` `grade` `years in management` IS
    IF `a new teacher`
    THEN IF `grade` AT MOST 2
         THEN 0.17
         ELSE IF `grade` AT MOST 4
              THEN 0.20
              ELSE 0.21
    ELSE IF `years in management` AT MOST 5
         THEN 0.17
         ELSE IF `years in management` AT MOST 10
              THEN 0.20
              ELSE 0.21

-- 11(2): a teacher who on appointment had a trailing management or
-- counselling bonus gets the higher of it and the management bonus.
@ref akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_2
GIVEN `management bonus` IS A NUMBER, `trailing bonus` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the bonus paid on appointment` `management bonus` `trailing bonus` IS
    max `management bonus` `trailing bonus`

-- A complementary special-education teacher has no role bonus.
@ref akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_2/p2 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_2/p3
`the complementary teacher's role bonus` MEANS 0

-- The cluster manager: under pre-reform terms until 31.8.2020; from
-- 1.9.2021 a management bonus of 25% up to 6 kindergartens and 28% from 7.
-- F-2021-22_tashpab_01-g: annex ו says the cluster manager was on
-- pre-reform terms in תשפ"א (2020-21) as well.
@ref akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_2/p4 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_2/p6 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_2/p7 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_2/p8 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_2/p9
GIVEN `kindergartens in the cluster` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the cluster manager's management bonus rate` `kindergartens in the cluster` IS
    IF `kindergartens in the cluster` AT MOST 6 THEN 0.25 ELSE 0.28

-- School years by the calendar year they open (2020 = תשפ"א).
@ref akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_2/p5
GIVEN `school year opening` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 11 has the cluster manager on pre-reform terms in` `school year opening` IF
    `school year opening` AT MOST 2019

@ref akn:att_6__hc_1/p83
GIVEN `school year opening` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `annex ו has the cluster manager on pre-reform terms in` `school year opening` IF
    `school year opening` AT MOST 2020

`section 11 and annex ו put תשפ"א on different terms` MEANS
    NOT (`section 11 has the cluster manager on pre-reform terms in` 2020 EQUALS `annex ו has the cluster manager on pre-reform terms in` 2020)
#ASSERT `section 11 and annex ו put תשפ"א on different terms`

-- A coordinating teacher in a cluster: a 10% education bonus, if she has no
-- trailing management bonus; a mentor: 2.4% an intern, up to three.
@ref akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_2/p10 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_2/p11 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_2/p12
GIVEN `has a trailing management bonus` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the cluster coordinator's education bonus rate` `has a trailing management bonus` IS
    IF `has a trailing management bonus` THEN 0 ELSE 0.10

@ref akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_2/p13 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_2/p14
GIVEN interns IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the mentor's bonus rate` interns IS
    0.024 TIMES min interns 3

-- The special-education supplement: 14% of the combined salary with a
-- special-education certification, 8.5% without.
@ref akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_2/p15 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_2/p16 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_2/p17
GIVEN `certified in special education` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the special-education supplement rate` `certified in special education` IS
    IF `certified in special education` THEN 0.14 ELSE 0.085

§§ `12 קביעת הדרגה באופק חדש`

-- 12 ¶2: the open file and the staff report are the basis of the initial
-- grade, so no grade can be set while the file is not opened, the position
-- not reported and the teacher not joined. (12.1, the Ministry alone, is
-- encoded with ¶7 of the introduction; 12.4, the salary to convert, with
-- annex ז 1ב.)
@ref akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_12 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_12/p2
GIVEN `file opened` IS A BOOLEAN, `position reported` IS A BOOLEAN, `joined` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a grade can be set` `file opened` `position reported` `joined` IF
        `file opened`
    AND `position reported`
    AND `joined`

-- 12.2-12.3: the grade rests on the employment, education and salary data;
-- an existing teacher's is set by the Ministry's accountant by conversion,
-- by the employment and salary data of March in the year before she moved
-- to the reform: seniority, education rank, training bonuses, role and the
-- stage of education, as the agreement sets.
@ref akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_12/p4 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_12/p5 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_12/p6 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_12/p7
@desc The March data a grade is converted from (section 12.3).
DECLARE `conversion data` HAS
    `seniority of the data`             IS A NUMBER
    `education rank of the data`        IS A NUMBER
    `training bonuses of the data`      IS A NUMBER
    `role of the data`                  IS A STRING
    `stage of education of the data`    IS A STRING

-- 12.5: the grade set in the conversion may be a half grade.
@ref akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_12/p10
GIVEN `grade` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a grade the conversion may give` `grade` IF
    `grade` TIMES 2 EQUALS FLOOR (`grade` TIMES 2)

-- akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_12/p11 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_12/p12 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_12/p13 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_12/p14 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_12/p15 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_12/p16 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_12/p17 More information and conferences to follow, annex ז's explanation, and links to the salary tables and the 2016 shekel-supplement circular; the conversion is encoded with annex ז below.

§§ `13 מקדמות שכר עד לקביעת הדרגה`

-- akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_13 The heading "13 salary advances"; no rule.

-- 13.1-13.2: until the grade is set, the owner pays a teacher who joined
-- an advance on top of the current salary, computed on the listed
-- components, for the part of the employment in a special-education
-- kindergarten that joined, from the joining date; "מקדמת אופק חדש". After
-- the grade is set, the Ofek salary is paid back to joining and the salary
-- and advances paid are set off.
@desc The groups §13.3 sets an advance rate for.
DECLARE `advance group` IS ONE OF
    `an academic kindergarten teacher`
    `an academic health professional`
    `an intern kindergarten teacher or health professional`
    `a non-academic with 28 years or a signed commitment`

@ref akn:art_f__para_13-3 akn:art_f__para_13-3/p2 akn:art_f__para_13-3/p3 akn:art_f__para_13-3/p4 akn:art_f__para_13-3/p5 akn:art_f__para_13-3/p6 akn:art_f__para_13-3/p7
GIVEN g IS AN `advance group`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the advance rate` g IS
    CONSIDER g
    WHEN `an academic kindergarten teacher` THEN 0.16
    WHEN `an academic health professional` THEN 0.17
    WHEN `an intern kindergarten teacher or health professional` THEN 0.14
    WHEN `a non-academic with 28 years or a signed commitment` THEN 0.10

@ref akn:art_f__para_13-1 akn:art_f__para_13-2
GIVEN g IS AN `advance group`
      `the listed components of the current salary` IS A NUMBER @desc the sum of the current salary's components §13.1 lists, for the part of the employment in the kindergarten that joined
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Ofek Hadash advance` g `the listed components of the current salary` IS
    `the advance rate` g TIMES `the listed components of the current salary`

-- 13.1: "יש לשלם" — the owner pays the advance, on top of the current
-- salary, until the grade is set. The text names no day of payment.
GIVEN `advance due` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `paying the advance` `advance due` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `pay the Ofek Hadash advance` `paid`
          PROVIDED `paid` AT LEAST `advance due`

@ref akn:art_f__para_13-2/p2
GIVEN `Ofek salary from joining` IS A NUMBER, `salary paid from joining` IS A NUMBER, `advances paid` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the arrears once the grade is set` `Ofek salary from joining` `salary paid from joining` `advances paid` IS
    `Ofek salary from joining` MINUS (`salary paid from joining` PLUS `advances paid`)

-- akn:art_f__para_13-3/p8 The reimbursement for the advance will be set out in a payment-system circular; no rule here.

§§ `14 עדיפות ההסכמים`

-- 14: the circular gathers the agreements' rules; where it contradicts them,
-- for or against the employee, the agreements prevail.
@ref akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14
GIVEN `what the circular says` IS A NUMBER, `what the agreements say` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the rule that applies` `what the circular says` `what the agreements say` IS
    `what the agreements say`

-- akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p2 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p3 The implementation conference at the end of August 2021 and the contact for questions; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p4 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p5 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p6 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p7 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p8 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p9 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p10 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p11 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p12 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p13 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p14 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p15 The sign-off and the first copies, which the corpus prints inside §14; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p16 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p17 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p18 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p19 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p20 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p21 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p22 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p23 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p24 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p25 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p26 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p27 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p28 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p29 The rest of the list of copies; no rule.

§§ `כתב התחייבות הבעלות`

-- The owner's commitment (printed by the corpus inside §14): due by
-- 15.8.2021 (encoded with §2.1.1); the signatory and owner fields.
-- akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p30 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p31 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p32 The commitment's title, deadline (encoded with §2.1.1) and the signatory's identification; no rule of their own.

-- (1) apply from תשפ"ב every Ofek Hadash provision concerning the teachers
-- in all the owner's special-education kindergartens: the week, the length
-- of the day, the pay and the pedagogical guidance; (2) give the Ministry
-- all data it asks for, as and when it asks; (4) collect and keep the
-- teachers' acknowledgements and pass them on when asked; (6) give the
-- Ministry the payslips when asked.
@ref akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14__cls_1 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14__cls_2 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14__cls_4 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14__cls_6
@desc What the owner's commitment binds it to.
DECLARE `committed matter` IS ONE OF
    `the Ofek Hadash work week`
    `the Ofek Hadash length of the school day`
    `pay by Ofek Hadash`
    `the pedagogical guidance on Ofek Hadash`
    `the data the Ministry asks for`
    `keeping the teachers' acknowledgements`
    `the payslips when asked`
    `the advance as directed`
    `the degree and certificate commitments`

GIVEN m IS A `committed matter`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the owner is committed to` m IF
    TRUE

-- (3) pay the advance by the Ministry's direction: (א) mark it on the
-- payslip "מקדמת אופק חדש"; (ב) send each teacher the letter of annex א,
-- that it is deducted in full on pay by the grade; (ג) have each teacher
-- sign the acknowledgement of annex ב.
@ref akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14__cls_3 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14__cls_3__pnt_a akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14__cls_3__pnt_a/p2 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14__cls_3__pnt_b akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14__cls_3__pnt_c
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `kindergarten action`
DECIDE `informing the teachers of the advance` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `send the Ofek Hadash advance letter and collect the teacher's acknowledgement`

`the payslip label of the advance` MEANS "מקדמת אופק חדש"

-- (5) have every teacher who lacks the qualification (a degree or an
-- equivalent grade and/or a teaching certificate) and wants to work under
-- Ofek Hadash sign the commitment to complete it (annex ג for a degree;
-- "annex ד" for a certificate) and send it to the Ministry.
@ref akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14__cls_5
GIVEN `academic` IS A BOOLEAN, `certified to teach` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the owner must have the teacher sign a completion commitment` `academic` `certified to teach` IF
        (NOT `academic`)
    OR  (NOT `certified to teach`)

-- (7) a teacher who for special personal reasons does not want to join may
-- apply to the exceptions committee through the owner (annex ה).
@ref akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14__cls_7
GIVEN g IS A `ground for leaving`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the teacher may ask not to join` g IF
    `a request to leave may be heard` g

-- ¶2: failing the commitment exposes the owner to sanctions — set-off of
-- what the Ministry budgeted for Ofek Hadash, up to revocation of the
-- licence.
@ref akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14__cls_7/p2
@desc The sanctions ¶2 names.
DECLARE `sanction` IS ONE OF
    `set-off of the Ofek Hadash budget`
    `revocation of the licence`

GIVEN `kept the commitment` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A LIST OF `sanction`
DECIDE `the sanctions the owner is exposed to` `kept the commitment` IS
    IF `kept the commitment` THEN EMPTY ELSE LIST `set-off of the Ofek Hadash budget`, `revocation of the licence`

-- akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14__cls_7/p3 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14__cls_7/p4 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14__cls_7/p5 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14__cls_7/p6 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14__cls_7/p7 The signatory's confirmation and the signature lines; no rule.

§§ `נספח א' מכתב לעובד ההוראה`

-- The letter to the teacher: the grade (and so the salary) is set by the
-- Ministry; until then an advance on account; then the Ofek salary paid,
-- the pre-reform salary and the whole advance deducted, subject to the
-- Wage Protection Law, 5718-1958; the advance appears as "מקדמת אופק חדש".
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1/p11 akn:att_1__hc_1/p13 akn:att_1__hc_1/p14 akn:att_1__hc_1/p15
GIVEN `Ofek salary` IS A NUMBER, `pre-reform salary paid` IS A NUMBER, `advance paid` IS A NUMBER, `most the Wage Protection Law allows to deduct` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `paid on setting the grade` `Ofek salary` `pre-reform salary paid` `advance paid` `most the Wage Protection Law allows to deduct` IS
    `Ofek salary` MINUS min (`pre-reform salary paid` PLUS `advance paid`) `most the Wage Protection Law allows to deduct`

-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p1 akn:att_1__hc_1/p2 akn:att_1__hc_1/p3 akn:att_1__hc_1/p4 akn:att_1__hc_1/p5 akn:att_1__hc_1/p6 akn:att_1__hc_1/p7 akn:att_1__hc_1/p8 akn:att_1__hc_1/p9 akn:att_1__hc_1/p10 The letter's keeping note (kept by the owner, encoded with §2.1.1), its address fields, greeting and subject; no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p12 akn:att_1__hc_1/p16 akn:att_1__hc_1/p17 akn:att_1__hc_1/p18 akn:att_1__hc_1/p19 akn:att_1__hc_1/p20 akn:att_1__hc_1/p21 Congratulations, the enclosure of annex ב, the signature and the page's letterhead; no rule.

§§ `נספח ב' כתב התחייבות לעובד ההוראה`

-- The teacher's acknowledgement: the Ofek component is an advance on what
-- the grade will bring, deducted in full with the pre-reform salary, and
-- no claims.
@ref akn:att_2__hc_1/p3 akn:att_2__hc_1/p4 akn:att_2__hc_1/p5 akn:att_2__hc_1/p6
GIVEN `signed the acknowledgement` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the advance is deducted in full` `signed the acknowledgement` IF
    TRUE

-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p1 akn:att_2__hc_1/p2 akn:att_2__hc_1/p7 akn:att_2__hc_1/p8 akn:att_2__hc_1/p9 akn:att_2__hc_1/p10 akn:att_2__hc_1/p11 akn:att_2__hc_1/p12 The keeping note, the title, the signature fields and the page's letterhead; no rule.

§§ `נספח ג' התחייבות להשלמת תואר`

-- The non-academic teacher's commitment, due by 31.12.2021 (§3.3.1): to
-- complete the degree within 4 years of SIGNING (¶10); completed within 4
-- years of JOINING, arrears back to the date of SIGNING (¶11).
-- F-2021-22_tashpab_01-e: §3.3.4 counts from joining and pays from joining.
@ref akn:att_3__hc_1/p1 akn:att_3__hc_1/p10 akn:att_3__hc_1/p11
GIVEN `months from signing to the degree` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the degree is within the commitment's window` `months from signing to the degree` IF
    `months from signing to the degree` AT MOST 48

-- A teacher who joined with the kindergarten on 1.9.2021, signed by the
-- form's deadline (31.12.2021, four months later) and completes the degree
-- 47 months after signing — 51 months after joining.
`months from joining to signing` MEANS 4
`months from signing to completion` MEANS 47

`section 3.3.4 and annex ג decide the same teacher differently` MEANS
        `the degree is within the commitment's window` `months from signing to completion`
    AND (NOT `arrears from joining under section 3.3.4` (`months from joining to signing` PLUS `months from signing to completion`))
#ASSERT `section 3.3.4 and annex ג decide the same teacher differently`

-- ¶12-16: what an academic degree is (§3.1.3); ¶17: the reform's terms
-- apply on signing.
@ref akn:att_3__hc_1/p12 akn:att_3__hc_1/p13 akn:att_3__hc_1/p14 akn:att_3__hc_1/p15 akn:att_3__hc_1/p16 akn:att_3__hc_1/p17
GIVEN `signed` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the reform's terms apply on signing the degree commitment` `signed` IF
    `signed`

-- akn:att_3__hc_1/p2 akn:att_3__hc_1/p3 akn:att_3__hc_1/p4 akn:att_3__hc_1/p5 akn:att_3__hc_1/p6 akn:att_3__hc_1/p7 akn:att_3__hc_1/p8 akn:att_3__hc_1/p9 The form's title and fields; no rule.
-- akn:att_3__hc_1/p18 akn:att_3__hc_1/p19 akn:att_3__hc_1/p20 akn:att_3__hc_1/p21 akn:att_3__hc_1/p22 akn:att_3__hc_1/p23 The signature line, the portal link and the page's letterhead; no rule.

§§ `נספח ד' בקשה להצטרפות חריגה`

-- The exceptional-joining form of an academic without a teaching
-- certificate, due by 31.12.2021 (§3.2.1): no promotion until certified,
-- and the reform's terms apply on signing.
@ref akn:att_4__hc_1/p1 akn:att_4__hc_1/p18 akn:att_4__hc_1/p19
GIVEN `signed the exceptional-joining form` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the reform's terms apply on signing the exceptional-joining form` `signed the exceptional-joining form` IF
    `signed the exceptional-joining form`

-- akn:att_4__hc_1/p2 akn:att_4__hc_1/p3 akn:att_4__hc_1/p4 akn:att_4__hc_1/p5 akn:att_4__hc_1/p6 akn:att_4__hc_1/p7 akn:att_4__hc_1/p8 akn:att_4__hc_1/p9 akn:att_4__hc_1/p10 The form's title and fields; no rule.
-- akn:att_4__hc_1/p11 akn:att_4__hc_1/p12 akn:att_4__hc_1/p13 akn:att_4__hc_1/p14 akn:att_4__hc_1/p15 akn:att_4__hc_1/p16 What an academic degree is, as §3.1.3 (encoded there); no rule of its own.
-- akn:att_4__hc_1/p17 akn:att_4__hc_1/p20 akn:att_4__hc_1/p21 akn:att_4__hc_1/p22 akn:att_4__hc_1/p23 akn:att_4__hc_1/p24 akn:att_4__hc_1/p25 The request line, the signature line, the portal link and the page's letterhead; no rule.

§§ `נספח ה' בקשה ליציאה מהרפורמה`

-- akn:att_5__hc_1 The form for asking the exceptions committee to leave the reform, due by 31.12.2021 (§3.6, encoded there): its title, fields, the owner's comment line, the portal link and letterhead; no rule of its own.

§§ `נספח ו' דוגמאות לחישוב היקף משרה`

-- Annex ו's examples of §4.1.5 (position = hours actually worked / base),
-- as its notes word them: a head teacher who is a mother and never absent
-- (+10%, 110%); an existing head teacher of 50-55 working the full week
-- (107%) or a day less every other week (96.3%); one of 55 and over
-- (115.15%, 103.63%, 92.12%); and so on. The full week is five days of
-- 6.08 hours (row 4's note, ¶15-¶16, and §4.1.4), 30.4, to 14:00 (¶82).
-- The bases below are §4.1.1's for the post and age band the note's row
-- names; the annex's own base column is part of the table, an input.
@ref akn:att_6__hc_1/p6 akn:att_6__hc_1/p7 akn:att_6__hc_1/p8 akn:att_6__hc_1/p9 akn:att_6__hc_1/p10 akn:att_6__hc_1/p11 akn:att_6__hc_1/p12 akn:att_6__hc_1/p13 akn:att_6__hc_1/p14 akn:att_6__hc_1/p27 akn:att_6__hc_1/p28 akn:att_6__hc_1/p29 akn:att_6__hc_1/p30 akn:att_6__hc_1/p31 akn:att_6__hc_1/p40 akn:att_6__hc_1/p41 akn:att_6__hc_1/p42 akn:att_6__hc_1/p43 akn:att_6__hc_1/p44 akn:att_6__hc_1/p45 akn:att_6__hc_1/p46 akn:att_6__hc_1/p47 akn:att_6__hc_1/p82
`the full week of a kindergarten teacher` MEANS 30.4

GIVEN `days off a fortnight` IS A NUMBER, base IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the annex's position in percent` `days off a fortnight` base IS
    TRUNC (`the extent of the position` (`the full week of a kindergarten teacher` MINUS 3.04 TIMES `days off a fortnight`) base TIMES 100) 2

#ASSERT `the annex's position in percent` 0 (`the base of the position` `a kindergarten head teacher` `under 50`) EQUALS 100
#ASSERT `the annex's position in percent` 0 (`the base of the position` `a kindergarten head teacher` `55 and over, an existing teacher`) EQUALS 115.15
#ASSERT `the annex's position in percent` 1 (`the base of the position` `a kindergarten head teacher` `55 and over, an existing teacher`) EQUALS 103.63
#ASSERT `the annex's position in percent` 2 (`the base of the position` `a kindergarten head teacher` `55 and over, an existing teacher`) EQUALS 92.12
#ASSERT `the annex's position in percent` 1 (`the base of the position` `a kindergarten head teacher` `50 to 55, 55 not included`) EQUALS 96.33
#ASSERT `a mother kindergarten teacher's position` 1 TRUE EQUALS 1.1

-- The complementary teacher's and cluster manager's rows (¶18-26, ¶48-81;
-- row 4's note, ¶15-17, is taken below)
-- apply the same rule on their own bases (the table itself is below).
@ref akn:att_6__hc_1/p18 akn:att_6__hc_1/p19 akn:att_6__hc_1/p20 akn:att_6__hc_1/p21 akn:att_6__hc_1/p22 akn:att_6__hc_1/p23 akn:att_6__hc_1/p24 akn:att_6__hc_1/p25 akn:att_6__hc_1/p26 akn:att_6__hc_1/p48 akn:att_6__hc_1/p49 akn:att_6__hc_1/p50 akn:att_6__hc_1/p51 akn:att_6__hc_1/p52 akn:att_6__hc_1/p53 akn:att_6__hc_1/p54 akn:att_6__hc_1/p55 akn:att_6__hc_1/p56 akn:att_6__hc_1/p57 akn:att_6__hc_1/p58 akn:att_6__hc_1/p59 akn:att_6__hc_1/p60 akn:att_6__hc_1/p61 akn:att_6__hc_1/p62 akn:att_6__hc_1/p63 akn:att_6__hc_1/p64 akn:att_6__hc_1/p65 akn:att_6__hc_1/p66 akn:att_6__hc_1/p72 akn:att_6__hc_1/p73 akn:att_6__hc_1/p74 akn:att_6__hc_1/p75 akn:att_6__hc_1/p76 akn:att_6__hc_1/p77 akn:att_6__hc_1/p78 akn:att_6__hc_1/p79 akn:att_6__hc_1/p80 akn:att_6__hc_1/p81
GIVEN p IS A `kindergarten post`, b IS AN `age band`, `hours actually worked` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position by the annex's rule` p b `hours actually worked` IS
    `the extent of the position` `hours actually worked` (`the base of the position` p b)

#ASSERT TRUNC (`the position by the annex's rule` `a complementary kindergarten teacher` `55 and over, an existing teacher` 30.4 TIMES 100) 0 EQUALS 102

-- Annex ו's table. Its columns, as the corpus prints the headings (¶1-¶5):
-- serial, post, job base, the position in percent (its asterisk, ¶82: "as
-- far as she works Sunday to Thursday 7:55-14:00 and Friday 7:55-12:45;
-- where the kindergarten's hours differ, so does the position"), the
-- weekly hours actually worked, and notes. The corpus publishes the table
-- as loose lines with each row's cells out of order and its notes broken
-- across lines, so which figure sits in which column of which row is not
-- something its text says (MMS-424). The rows are an input until the
-- corpus publishes the table and is re-synced; the notes that read as
-- prose are encoded above and below.
@ref akn:att_6__hc_1
DECLARE `annex ו row` HAS
    `annex ו serial`        IS A NUMBER
    `annex ו post`          IS A STRING
    `annex ו base`          IS A NUMBER
    `annex ו percent`       IS A NUMBER        @desc the position as printed, in percent
    `annex ו hours worked`  IS A MAYBE NUMBER  @desc the weekly hours actually worked, NOTHING where the cell is blank

@desc Annex ו's rows, one per printed row in the printed order. The corpus publishes this table scrambled (MMS-424), so the values are supplied from outside until the corpus is fixed and re-synced.
ASSUME `annex ו's rows` IS A LIST OF `annex ו row`

-- The empty row stands for a serial the table does not print.
GIVEN l IS A LIST OF `annex ו row`
GIVETH AN `annex ו row`
DECIDE `the first annex ו row of` l IS
    CONSIDER l
    WHEN EMPTY THEN `annex ו row` 0 "" 0 0 NOTHING
    WHEN r FOLLOWED BY rest THEN r

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER, l IS A LIST OF `annex ו row`
GIVETH AN `annex ו row`
DECIDE `the annex ו row numbered` n `in` l IS
    `the first annex ו row of` (filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `annex ו serial` EQUALS n) l)

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `annex ו row`
DECIDE `annex ו row number` n IS
    `the annex ו row numbered` n `in` `annex ו's rows`

-- PLACEHOLDER rows (invented figures, not the table's) for the lookup.
`placeholder annex ו rows` MEANS
    LIST `annex ו row` 1 "placeholder post" 10 100 (JUST 10),
         `annex ו row` 2 "placeholder post" 20 50  NOTHING

#ASSERT (`the annex ו row numbered` 2 `in` `placeholder annex ו rows`)'s `annex ו base` EQUALS 20
#ASSERT (`the annex ו row numbered` 3 `in` `placeholder annex ו rows`)'s `annex ו serial` EQUALS 0

-- F-2021-22_tashpab_01-i: row 4's note (¶15-¶17) says five days of 6.08
-- hours — 30.4 — and then that she "actually works 30.8 hours". 90%, the
-- position the note gives, is 30.4 over §4.1.1's base for her (33.8), not
-- 30.8.
@ref akn:att_6__hc_1/p15 akn:att_6__hc_1/p16 akn:att_6__hc_1/p17
`the weekly hours row 4's note says she actually works` MEANS 30.8
`the position row 4's note gives, in percent` MEANS 90

`row 4's note gives two weekly hours for one week` MEANS
        NOT (`the weekly hours row 4's note says she actually works` EQUALS `the full week of a kindergarten teacher`)
    AND `hours in the working day` (`end of day Sunday to Thursday` `every other kind of class`) TIMES 5 EQUALS `the full week of a kindergarten teacher`
    AND ROUND (`the extent of the position` `the full week of a kindergarten teacher` (`the base of the position` `a complementary kindergarten teacher` `under 50`) TIMES 100) EQUALS `the position row 4's note gives, in percent`
    AND ROUND (`the extent of the position` `the weekly hours row 4's note says she actually works` (`the base of the position` `a complementary kindergarten teacher` `under 50`) TIMES 100) EQUALS 91
#ASSERT `row 4's note gives two weekly hours for one week`

-- The reading adopted (F-2021-22_tashpab_01-i): five days of 6.08 hours,
-- 30.4, as the note's first figure and §4.1.4 have it.

-- akn:att_6__hc_1/p1 akn:att_6__hc_1/p2 akn:att_6__hc_1/p3 akn:att_6__hc_1/p4 akn:att_6__hc_1/p5 akn:att_6__hc_1/p32 akn:att_6__hc_1/p33 akn:att_6__hc_1/p34 The table's column headings and the page's letterhead; no rule.
-- akn:att_6__hc_1/p35 akn:att_6__hc_1/p36 akn:att_6__hc_1/p37 akn:att_6__hc_1/p38 akn:att_6__hc_1/p39 akn:att_6__hc_1/p67 akn:att_6__hc_1/p68 akn:att_6__hc_1/p69 akn:att_6__hc_1/p70 akn:att_6__hc_1/p71 The table's column headings, repeated on later pages; no rule.

§§ `נספח ז' קביעת דרגה והמרות שכר`

-- ¶1-5: an existing teacher's grade is set by converting the salary; a new
-- one is placed at grade 1 without conversion; the Ministry alone sets it.
@ref akn:att_7__hc_1/p1 akn:att_7__hc_1/p2 akn:att_7__hc_1/p3 akn:att_7__hc_1/p4 akn:att_7__hc_1/p5
GIVEN t IS A `kindergarten teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the salary is converted` t IF
    `an existing teaching employee` t

`the grade a new teacher is placed at` MEANS 1

-- 1א: A = X × (100 + Y)%.
@ref akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_a akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_a/p2 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_a/p3 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_a/p4 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_a/p5 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_a/p6 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_c akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_c/p2
GIVEN x IS A NUMBER, y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the salary after conversion` x y IS
    x TIMES ((100 PLUS y) DIVIDED BY 100)

-- 1ב: X is the March salary of the school year before joining at 100% by
-- the roles, from the listed components (the joining month if not employed
-- in March).
@ref akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p2 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p3 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p4 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_12/p8 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_12/p9
GIVEN `components at the position held` IS A NUMBER, `position fraction` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the salary to convert` `components at the position held` `position fraction` IS
    `components at the position held` DIVIDED BY `position fraction`

-- ¶5-7: Y for a kindergarten teacher: 16% if academic, 14.4% if not (16%
-- × 0.9).
@ref akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p5 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p6 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p7
GIVEN `academic` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the kindergarten teacher's coefficient` `academic` IS
    IF `academic` THEN 16 ELSE 16 TIMES 0.9

#ASSERT `the kindergarten teacher's coefficient` FALSE EQUALS 14.4

-- akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p8 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p9 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p10 The page's letterhead; no rule.

GIVEN x IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `to the agora` x IS
    ROUND (x TIMES 100) DIVIDED BY 100

-- The example: an academic kindergarten teacher with a first degree, at
-- 0.9 of a position; the components it lists.
@ref akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p11 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p12 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p13 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p14 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p15 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p16 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p17 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p18 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p19 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p20 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p21 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p22 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p23 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p24
`the example's components` MEANS
    LIST 3779.38, 141.21, 113.38, 187.25, 259.08, 157.03, 268.82, 900.54, 298.69

#ASSERT sum `the example's components` EQUALS 6105.38

-- ¶25: X = 6,105.38 / 0.9 = 6,783.75 (truncated to the agora).
@ref akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p25
`the example's X` MEANS TRUNC (`the salary to convert` (sum `the example's components`) 0.9) 2

#ASSERT `the example's X` EQUALS 6783.75

-- ¶26-27: X times 1.034, "תוספת שחיקה" (an erosion supplement), which the
-- formula (1א) and the definition of X (1ב) do not mention, printed as
-- 7,014.39 (truncated to the agora, as X was); Y = 16%. 1ג: A = 8,136.69.
@ref akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p26 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p27
`the erosion supplement the example applies` MEANS 1.034

`the example's X with the erosion supplement` MEANS
    TRUNC (`the example's X` TIMES `the erosion supplement the example applies`) 2

#ASSERT `the example's X with the erosion supplement` EQUALS 7014.39

`the example's printed A` MEANS 8136.69

#ASSERT `to the agora` (`the salary after conversion` `the example's X with the erosion supplement` 16) EQUALS `the example's printed A`

-- F-2021-22_tashpab_01-h: the formula as stated does not give the example's A.
`the conversion example applies a supplement the formula does not state` MEANS
    NOT (`to the agora` (`the salary after conversion` `the example's X` 16) EQUALS `the example's printed A`)
#ASSERT `the conversion example applies a supplement the formula does not state`

-- 1ד: placed on the academic table by total seniority at the grade nearest
-- A, equal or higher. The example: seniority 10 (8 years + 21 months'
-- service), ₪8,368.38, grade 4. The tables are not in the circular.
@ref akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_d akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_d/p2 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_d/p3 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_d/p4
GIVEN `salary at the grade` IS A NUMBER, a IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the grade may be the placement` `salary at the grade` a IF
    `salary at the grade` AT LEAST a

#ASSERT `the grade may be the placement` 8368.38 `the example's printed A`

-- akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_d/p5 The heading "דגשים"; no rule.

-- Notes: a new academic (after the internship) at grade 1 and seniority 1,
-- without conversion; one absent without pay in the year before joining is
-- converted on September's salary of the joining year.
@ref akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_d__cls_1 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_d__cls_1__pnt_1 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_d__cls_1__pnt_2
GIVEN `on unpaid absence in the year before joining` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the month the salary to convert is taken from` `on unpaid absence in the year before joining` IS
    IF `on unpaid absence in the year before joining`
    THEN "September of the year of joining"
    ELSE "March of the school year before joining"

`the grade and seniority a new academic is placed at after the internship, without conversion` MEANS 1

§§ `נספח ח' פרטי קשר`

-- akn:att_8__hc_1 The national service centre, the districts' reception hours and addresses; no rule.

§§ `Worked examples`

`an existing certified academic at 40%` MEANS
    `kindergarten teacher` WITH
        `years of recognised actual teaching`        IS 8
        `years of seniority`                         IS 10
        `academic`                                   IS TRUE
        `certified to teach`                         IS TRUE
        `position fraction`                          IS 0.4
        `kindergarten joined Ofek Hadash`            IS TRUE
        `signed the commitment to complete a degree` IS FALSE
        `approved by the exceptions committee`       IS FALSE
        `an intern`                                  IS FALSE

`an existing non-academic with 20 years who has not signed` MEANS
    `kindergarten teacher` 20 20 FALSE TRUE 0.8 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE

#ASSERT `joins Ofek Hadash` `an existing certified academic at 40%`
#ASSERT NOT `joins Ofek Hadash` `an existing non-academic with 20 years who has not signed`
#ASSERT `how the teacher is paid` `an existing certified academic at 40%` FALSE EQUALS "the current salary and the Ofek Hadash advance"
#ASSERT `the base of the position` `a kindergarten cluster manager` (`the age band of` 52 TRUE) EQUALS 32
#ASSERT `the Ofek Hadash advance` `an academic kindergarten teacher` 5000 EQUALS 800
#ASSERT `the placement above 100% is allowed` FALSE 1.2 40 FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the placement above 100% is allowed` FALSE 1.2 44 TRUE

#TRACE `submitting the commitment to join` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `submit the commitment to join Ofek Hadash through the portal` AT 15
#TRACE `one reporting officer, personally` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `appoint a second reporting officer` AT 30
